---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section id="step-2" class="step-panel" aria-label="Settlement" hidden>
  <section aria-labelledby="settlement-title">
    <h2 id="settlement-title" class="sr-only">Who pays whom</h2>
    <p id="settlement-description" class="field-hint"></p>
    <div id="transfers" class="transfers"></div>
    <p class="field-hint">Make these payments with your usual payment app or cash.</p>
  </section>
  <details id="crew-balances" class="balance-section">
    <summary><Icon name="crew" size={20} /> Show balances</summary>
    <p id="group-settlement-note" class="field-hint" hidden>
      Groups settle together. Their payments cover everyone listed in the group.
    </p>
    <div id="balance-cards" class="balance-cards"></div>
    <details id="individual-balances" class="calculation-note" hidden>
      <summary>Each shipmate’s share</summary>
      <p class="field-hint">
        These individual balances are already included in the payments above.
      </p>
      <div id="member-balance-cards" class="balance-cards"></div>
    </details>
    <details class="calculation-note">
      <summary>Show the workings</summary>
      <p>
        Each person’s balance is what they paid minus their share. Groups combine
        those balances to settle together; adding or changing a group never changes
        a saved cost’s split. Payments settle those totals, so you may pay someone
        other than the original payer. Items split evenly among the selected people.
        Receipt tax and tip follow each person’s item subtotal; extra pennies go to
        the largest fractional remainders, with recorded order breaking ties.
        Open a cost to see the exact shares.
      </p>
    </details>
  </details>
  <div class="export-section">
    <div class="export-actions">
      <button type="button" class="button button-primary" id="export-pdf">
        <Icon name="print" size={17} /> Save PDF
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="button button-secondary" id="export-csv">
        <Icon name="download" size={17} /> Download CSV
      </button>
    </div>
    <label class="export-detail">
      <input id="pdf-details" type="checkbox" /> Include receipt &amp; split details in PDF
    </label>
    <p class="field-hint">Choose “Save as PDF” in the print dialog.</p>
    <p class="field-hint">
      Share the CSV and this site’s link. Your crew can import their own copy of the trip.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="step-footer">
    <button type="button" class="text-button" data-step="1">
      <span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Ship’s tab
    </button>
  </div>
</section>
